-    ----------
-    fourier_coefficients : ndarray,
-        shape (n_time_windows, n_trials, n_tapers, n_fft_samples, n_signals)
-    max_rank : int
-        Number of strongest components to return.
-
-    Returns
-    -------
-    global_coherence : ndarray, shape (n_time_windows, n_fft_samples, max_rank)
